INTERVIEW TRAP QUESTIONS
======================================================================

Trap 1

Question

Does Lombok execute at runtime?

Correct Answer

No.

Lombok generates code during compilation.

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Trap 2

Question

Is Lombok part of Java?

Correct Answer

No.

Lombok is an external Java library.

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Trap 3

Question

Does @Data generate Constructors?

Correct Answer

Yes.

@Data generates @RequiredArgsConstructor.

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Trap 4

Question

Does @Value generate Setter methods?

Correct Answer

No.

@Value creates immutable classes and does not generate setters.

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Trap 5

Question

Which annotation automatically creates a Logger?

Correct Answer

@Slf4j

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Trap 6

Question

Which annotation is best for object creation with many fields?

Correct Answer

@Builder

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Trap 7

Question

Can @Builder replace Constructors?

Correct Answer

No.

@Builder provides an alternative and more readable way to create
objects, but constructors can still exist.

